  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html",
  "prefLabel": "Plc 2004.03 Continuing Education Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2004.03 Continuing Education Required.\n\n(a) Certificants shall complete a minimum of 6 continuing education credits during the 2-year period prior to each renewal of certification.\n\n(b) The credits shall be earned through any combination of live programming and self-directed study programs.\n\n(c) Continuing education events offered or approved by an approved training organization shall qualify for continuing education credits.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html"
